Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in: 4.5.beta1\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.5.beta1 - Windows 11 (build 22631) - Multi-window, 2 monitors - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated AMD Radeon RX 6950 XT (Advanced Micro Devices, Inc.; 32.0.21013.1000) - 13th Gen Intel(R) Core(TM) i5-13600KF (20 threads) - 31.84 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nSetting a 3D node as top_level while having the physics interpolation on will make it interpolate from its old local tranform to its now transform (this is my assumption)\n\nNote: This happen with the new scene traversal algorithm and with the legacy one\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/25d405cd-3e63-4bfc-ae13-f9831bb5edac\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- Set a 3D node that have a parent node with have some transformations as top_level during runtime\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[PhysicsInterpolationTopLevelBug_MRP.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/20962635/PhysicsInterpolationTopLevelBug_MRP.zip)\n(just run the scene node_3d.tscn)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.git